 "Compare this figure across the models listed below before choosing.": "specNote",
 "A larger cup means fewer empties; a compact body reaches tighter spaces.": "specNote",
 "Multi-in-1 functions widen the use case; check what is included in the box.": "specNote",
 "Food-contact and boiler materials should be stainless steel with the relevant certification.": "specNote",
 "Pressure tells you how deeply steam penetrates grout, seals and seams.": "specNote",
 "Laser/SLAM mapping builds a real floor plan; gyroscope units wander.": "specNote",
 "Wattage is input power, not lifting force — read it together with the suction figure.": "specNote",
 "Runtime decides how much floor one charge covers — check whether the battery is removable.": "specNote",
 "Higher Pa lifts more debris; compare Pa together with motor type (brushed vs brushless).": "specNote",
 "Tank capacity sets how long a session runs before a refill.": "specNote",
 "Weight decides whether the tool is actually used for a full room or mattress.": "specNote",
 "Dust box and water tank size decide mopping area per cycle.": "specNote",
 "HEPA filtration traps the allergen the machine has just released.": "specNote",
 "For home espresso, pressure stability during extraction matters more than the peak bar rating.": "specNote",
